# turbofit-memory-threshold-monitor
owner: anser · cadence: live generation monitoring · status: SUGGESTED
**Want me to watch for prefill_admission_shed events that indicate memory pressure before OOM kills?**

## Prompt
Watch for prefill_admission_shed or memory guard events during TurboFit generation, log the threshold_bytes and limit_bytes, and alert if threshold is within 10% of limit_bytes

## Evidence
> MTPLX memory guard shows threshold at ~24.99 GB on 25.77 GB limit
> Code -9 exits correlated with memory guard triggering during 131K prompts
